  {
   "id": "the-crew-2@major-2026-04-22",
   "gameId": "the-crew-2",
   "displayName": "The Crew 2 Hybrid Mode Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-22T11:00:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The Crew 2 – April 2026 Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Last October, we rolled out Hybrid Mode in The Crew 2, giving you the opportunity to launch the game either online or offline.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Since then, we’ve read tons of your messages and feedback about this new mode and just want to say thank you for all the enthusiasm and support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]With the help of your incredibly valuable feedback, which has led to the release of this update, it’s helped us shape this Hybrid mode even further to add more features you have been asking for.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "FEATURES",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Up until now, adding and saving your liveries was impossible in your offline session. With this update, one of most requested features you have been asking for is now possible, and you’ll be able to create and add your favourite customization to your offline save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Offline “My livery” menu is now available",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "You can now create new liveries here",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There, you’ll be able to find the liveries you’ve created offline and those you saved from online",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now create and save sticker groups (custom forms) as well as those you saved from online",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Online “My livery” export",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]We know that some of the best liveries have already been created by other players. That’s why we’re also giving you the option to save your favourite online liveries to your offline save!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now save offline liveries from the online mode (Save offline button)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now save offline sticker groups (custom forms) from the online mode (Save offline button)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29149319/b17369b9137140de0636cd596f73c4403b352141.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "STATISTICS",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]You told us that statistics regarding your progression and your vehicles were missing, and that this was something important to you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]That’s why you can now add your statistics from Online to your Offline save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pilot statistics can be added into your offline profile",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vehicles statistics can be added into your offline profile",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Offline statistics now progress on your offline save",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29149319/df81a029f88d3b49f6c4715a2834798c5b58aa54.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29149319/e057aec5660d53d3e1aed1dd552ac50116bee400.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "USER INTERFACE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]After launching the offline mode, it could be frustrating to have to relaunch the game to switch between offline and online mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]That’s why we’ve added an option in the menu to allow you to back to the login screen, so that you can dive straight back in.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Back to login button added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/29149319/ad93c539c93e947bda48e6e1f9b5d849e6294fb9.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "MISC",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Various fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Automatic save pop-up shows up only one time per session from now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]We hope this update added some of the features you had been hoping for to make your The Crew 2 offline experience the best it can be!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Thank you to all of our players who have left us their valuable feedback so far. We’re always happy and eager to receive this to ensure we can continue to refine and update the game to your wishes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Our eyes are always peeled on our social media platforms and Discord, so please do continue to send us your feedback and insight as we continue to work on the Crew franchise.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
