      {
       "text": "Race Creator is here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players now have the ability to create, publish, and share their own races.: The Crew Motorfest Collection Import information.: 4 New Stories will be available in Episode 1 and will be focusing on the background of some of the hosts in The Crew Motorfest: Malu, Pierce, Jim, and Toji.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Episode 1 will also have the 'Road to O'ahu' new event.: Dual Currency Purchases.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Introducing Dual Currency purchases, you can complete the purchase of a vehicle with another currency if you are missing the full amount of one currency.: Activity Tickets updated with screenshots accurately representing the events.",
