  {
   "id": "the-crew-2@major-2023-03-21",
   "gameId": "the-crew-2",
   "displayName": "The Crew 2 Season 8 Patch Notes",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-21T16:52:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The Crew 2 Season 8 - Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "After having travelled the East and West of the United States during Season 3, the US Speed Tour is making a comeback in Season 8! This Season is bringing brand new events, new vehicles, a whole new playground, and more vanity items than you could shake a checkered flag at. Strap in for the Patch Notes breakdown!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For a more detailed breakdown of the content released with The Crew 2 Season 8 Episode 1: USST Cities, please refer to the Content Overview.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please follow our official channels for any additional updates.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "TOURING CAR & ALPHA GP HANDLING UPDATE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks to your feedback, we have worked to improve the consistency of the handling of vehicles in the same category. Since Season 5 with the Rallycross category, but also during the following Seasons on the Touring Car category. With Season 8, we are happy to announce that we are bringing a new milestone by rolling out handling improvements for all the vehicles in the Touring Car and Alpha GP categories that have not been updated until now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You will find below a list of the Touring Cars and AGP vehicles that are affected by this latest handling update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Touring Car",
     "items": [
